    "description": "<p>1. Query test of SGCL12&nbsp;[SGCL12QueryTestSet.txt]</p>\n\n<p>2. Outputs of 16 nesting algorithms on the query&nbsp;test set of SGCL12 [Input flat segmention: Saha Roy et al., SIGIR&nbsp;2012] [Nested Segmentation Outputs SGCL12.zip]</p>\n\n<p>3. Query set of TREC-WT [TREC-WTQueryTestSet.txt]</p>\n\n<p>4. Outputs of 16 nesting algorithms on the query test set of TREC-WT&nbsp;&nbsp;[Input flat segmention: Saha Roy et al.,&nbsp;SIGIR&nbsp;2012] [Nested Segmentation Outputs TREC-WT.zip]</p>\n\n<p>5.&nbsp;Code and executables&nbsp;for generating the nested segmentations for a set of queries [Code and execs for generating nested segmentations.zip]</p>\n\n<p>6.&nbsp;Code and executables&nbsp;for&nbsp;IR-based&nbsp;evaluation of a nested segmentation [Code and execs for IR evaluation of a nested segmentation.zip]</p>\n\n<p>7.&nbsp;Readme.txt</p>",
